hadiths[102]{hadithnumber,text}:
"326","Mujhe Yahya ne Malik se, unhon ne Dawood bin Husain se, unhon ne Aaraj se, unhon ne Abu Huraira se riwayat kya ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) Tabuk ke safar mein Zuhr aur Asr ko jama karte they."
"327","Mujhe Malik se, unhon ne Makki Abu Zubair se, unhon ne Abu Tufail Amir bin Wasila se riwayat kya ke Muaz bin Jabal ne unhein khabar di ke wo Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ke sath Tabuk ke saal nikle aur Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) Zuhr aur Asr aur Maghrib aur Isha ko jama karte they. Unhon ne kaha ke Aap ne aik din Namaz mein takheer ki phir nikle aur Zuhr aur Asr dono ko jama karke padha, phir dakhil hue phir nikle aur Maghrib aur Isha dono ko jama karke padha, phir farmaya ke tum kal agar Allah ne chaha Tabuk ke chashme par aaoge aur tum us par na aaoge yahan tak ke din chadh jaye, phir jo us par aae wo us ke pani mein se koi cheez na chhue yahan tak ke main aaun. Phir hum us par aae jab ke do shakhs hum se pehle us par pahunch chuke they aur chashma thode pani se tapak raha tha, to Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne un dono se sawal kya ke kya tum ne us ke pani mein se koi cheez chhui. Dono ne kaha ke haan. To Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne unhein bura kaha aur un dono se jo Allah ne chaha kaha, phir unhon ne apne haathon se chashme mein se thoda thoda pani liya yahan tak ke kisi cheez mein jama hua, phir Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne is mein apna chehra aur apne haath dhoe phir use is mein lauta diya to chashma bahut pani se behne laga aur logon ne pani pilaya, phir Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya ke aey Muaz qarib hai ke agar tumhari zindagi lambi hui to tum yahan dekho ge ke baghon se bhar gaya hai."
"328","Mujhe Malik se, unhon ne Nafi se riwayat kya ke Abdullah bin Umar ne kaha ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) jab safar mein jaldi hoti to Maghrib aur Isha ko jama karte they."
"329","Mujhe Malik se, unhon ne Makki Abu Zubair se, unhon ne Saeed bin Jubair se, unhon ne Abdullah bin Abbas se riwayat kya ke unhon ne kaha ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne Zuhr aur Asr dono ko jama karke aur Maghrib aur Isha dono ko jama karke padha baghair khauf aur baghair safar ke."
"330","Mujhe Malik se, unhon ne Nafi se riwayat kya ke Abdullah bin Umar jab umara barish mein Maghrib aur Isha ko jama karte to un ke sath jama karte."
"331","Mujhe Malik se, unhon ne Ibn Shihab se riwayat kya ke unhon ne Salim bin Abdullah se sawal kya ke kya safar mein Zuhr aur Asr ko jama kya jata hai, to unhon ne kaha ke haan, is mein koi harj nahi, kya tum ne Arafa mein logon ki Namaz na dekhi."
"332","Mujhe Malik se riwayat pahunchi ke Ali bin Husain kehte they ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) jab apne din mein chalna chahte to Zuhr aur Asr ko jama karte aur jab apni raat mein chalna chahte to Maghrib aur Isha ko jama karte."
"333","Mujhe Yahya ne Malik se, unhon ne Ibn Shihab se, unhon ne Khalid bin Usaid ke gharane mein se aik shakhs se riwayat kya ke unhon ne Abdullah bin Umar se sawal kya aur kaha ke aey Abu Abdur Rahman hum Quran mein khauf ki Namaz aur hazar ki Namaz pate hain aur safar ki Namaz nahi pate, to Ibn Umar ne kaha ke aey mere bhai ke bete Allah Azza wa Jal ne hamari taraf Muhammad (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ko bheja jab ke hum koi cheez na jante they, to hum waisa hi karte hain jaisa hum ne unhein karte dekha."
"334","Mujhe Malik se, unhon ne Salih bin Kaisan se, unhon ne Urwa bin Zubair se, unhon ne Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ki zauja Aaisha se riwayat kya ke unhon ne kaha ke Namaz do do rakat farz hui hazar aur safar mein, phir safar ki Namaz qaraar rakhi gai aur hazar ki Namaz mein izafa kya gaya."
"335","Mujhe Malik se, unhon ne Yahya bin Saeed se riwayat kya ke unhon ne Salim bin Abdullah se kaha ke tum ne apne walid ko safar mein Maghrib mein sab se zyada takheer karte kya dekha, to Salim ne kaha ke suraj ghuroob hua jab ke hum Zaat-ul-Jaish mein they to unhon ne Maghrib Aqiq mein padhi."
"336","Mujhe Yahya ne Malik se, unhon ne Nafi se riwayat kya ke Abdullah bin Umar jab Hajj ya Umra ke liye nikalte to Zul Hulaifa mein Namaz qasr karte."
"337","Mujhe Malik se, unhon ne Ibn Shihab se, unhon ne Salim bin Abdullah se, unhon ne apne walid se riwayat kya ke wo Reem ki taraf sawaar hue aur apne is safar mein Namaz qasr ki. Malik ne kaha ke ye chaar burd jaisa tha."
"338","Mujhe Malik se, unhon ne Nafi se, unhon ne Salim bin Abdullah se riwayat kya ke Abdullah bin Umar Zaat-un-Nasb ki taraf sawaar hue aur apne is safar mein Namaz qasr ki. Malik ne kaha ke Zaat-un-Nasb aur Madina ke darmiyan chaar burd hain."
"339","Mujhe Malik se, unhon ne Nafi se, unhon ne Ibn Umar se riwayat kya ke wo Khaibar ki taraf safar karte to Namaz qasr karte."
"340","Mujhe Malik se, unhon ne Ibn Shihab se, unhon ne Salim bin Abdullah se riwayat kya ke Abdullah bin Umar apne pure din ke safar mein Namaz qasr karte they."
"341","Mujhe Malik se, unhon ne Nafi se riwayat kya ke wo Ibn Umar ke sath aik burd ka safar karte to Namaz qasr na karte."
"342","Mujhe Malik se riwayat pahunchi ke Abdullah bin Abbas Makka aur Taif ke darmiyan jaisa aur Makka aur Usfan ke darmiyan jaisa aur Makka aur Jeddah ke darmiyan jaisa Namaz qasr karte they. Malik ne kaha ke ye chaar burd hai aur ye mere nazdeek sab se pasandida hai jis mein Namaz qasr ki jaye. Malik ne kaha ke jo safar ka irada kare wo Namaz qasr na kare yahan tak ke basti ke gharon se nikal jaye, aur puri na kare yahan tak ke basti ke pehle gharon mein dakhil ho ya is ke qareeb ho."
"343","Mujhe Yahya ne Malik se, unhon ne Ibn Shihab se, unhon ne Salim bin Abdullah se riwayat kya ke Abdullah bin Umar kehte they ke main musafir ki Namaz padhta hun jab tak theharne ka irada jama na karun, chahe ye mujhe barah raatein rok le."
"344","Mujhe Malik se, unhon ne Nafi se riwayat kya ke Ibn Umar Makka mein dus raatein thehre aur Namaz qasr karte siwa is ke ke use Imam ke sath padhte to us ki Namaz se padhte."
"345","Mujhe Yahya ne Malik se, unhon ne Khurasani Ata se riwayat kya ke unhon ne Saeed bin Musayyab ko kehte suna ke jo safar mein chaar raaton ke theharne ka irada jama kare wo Namaz puri kare. Malik ne kaha ke ye jo maine suna hai us mein sab se pasandida hai. Aur Malik se qaidi ki Namaz ke bare mein sawal kya gaya to unhon ne kaha ke muqeem ki Namaz jaisi hai siwa is ke ke wo musafir ho."
"346","Mujhe Yahya ne Malik se, unhon ne Ibn Shihab se, unhon ne Salim bin Abdullah se, unhon ne apne walid se riwayat kya ke Umar bin Khattab jab Makka aate to unhein do rakat padhate phir kehte ke aey Makka walon apni Namaz puri karo kyunke hum safar wali qoum hain."
"347","Mujhe Malik se, unhon ne Zaid bin Aslam se, unhon ne apne walid se, unhon ne Umar bin Khattab se waisa hi riwayat kya."
"348","Mujhe Malik se, unhon ne Nafi se riwayat kya ke Abdullah bin Umar Mina mein Imam ke peechhe chaar padhte they, phir jab apne liye padhte to do padhte."
"349","Mujhe Malik se, unhon ne Ibn Shihab se, unhon ne Safwan se riwayat kya ke unhon ne kaha ke Abdullah bin Umar Abdullah bin Safwan ki iyadat ke liye aae aur humein do rakat padhai phir laute, to hum khade hue aur puri ki."
"350","Mujhe Yahya ne Malik se, unhon ne Nafi se, unhon ne Abdullah bin Umar se riwayat kya ke wo safar mein farz Namaz ke sath is se pehle aur na is ke baad koi cheez padhte they siwa raat ke darmiyan ke, kyunke wo zameen par aur apni sawari par jidhar wo mutawajja hoti Namaz padhte they."
"351","Mujhe Malik se riwayat pahunchi ke Qasim bin Muhammad aur Urwa bin Zubair aur Abu Bakr bin Abdur Rahman safar mein nafl padhte they. Yahya ne kaha ke Malik se safar mein nafl ke bare mein sawal kya gaya to unhon ne kaha ke is mein koi harj nahi raat mein aur din mein, aur mujhe khabar pahunchi hai ke ahl-e-ilm mein se baaz aisa karte they."
"352","Mujhe Malik se riwayat kya ke unhein Nafi se khabar pahunchi ke Abdullah bin Umar apne bete Ubaidullah bin Abdullah ko safar mein nafl padhte dekhte to us par inkar na karte."
"353","Mujhe Malik se, unhon ne Amr bin Yahya Mazni se, unhon ne Abu Hubab Saeed bin Yasar se, unhon ne Abdullah bin Umar se riwayat kya ke unhon ne kaha ke maine Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ko dekha ke Aap gadhe par Namaz padh rahe they jab ke Aap Khaibar ki taraf mutawajja they."
"354","Mujhe Malik se, unhon ne Abdullah bin Dinar se, unhon ne Abdullah bin Umar se riwayat kya ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) safar mein apni sawari par Namaz padhte they jidhar wo Aap ko mutawajja karti. Abdullah bin Dinar ne kaha ke Abdullah bin Umar aisa karte they."
"355","Mujhe Malik se, unhon ne Yahya bin Saeed se riwayat kya ke unhon ne kaha ke maine Anas bin Malik ko safar mein dekha jab ke wo gadhe par Namaz padh rahe they aur qibla ke siwa mutawajja they, ruku aur sajda ishare se karte baghair is ke ke apna chehra kisi cheez par rakhein."
"356","Mujhe Yahya ne Malik se, unhon ne Musa bin Maisara se, unhon ne Aqeel bin Abi Talib ke ghulam Abu Murra se riwayat kya ke Abu Talib ki beti Umm Hani ne unhein khabar di ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne Fatah ke saal aath rakat Namaz padhi jab ke Aap aik kapde mein lapete hue they."
"357","Mujhe Malik se, unhon ne Umar bin Ubaidullah ke ghulam Abul Nazar se riwayat kya ke Aqeel bin Abi Talib ke ghulam Abu Murra ne unhein khabar di ke unhon ne Abu Talib ki beti Umm Hani ko kehte suna ke main Fatah ke saal Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ke paas gai aur Aap ko paya ke ghusl kar rahe they aur Aap ki beti Fatima Aap ko kapde se parda kar rahi thin. Unhon ne kaha ke maine Aap ko salam kya to Aap ne farmaya ke ye kaun hai. Maine kaha ke Umm Hani bint Abi Talib. To Aap ne farmaya ke Umm Hani ko khush aamdeed. Phir jab Aap apne ghusl se farigh hue to khade hue aur aik kapde mein lapete hue aath rakat Namaz padhi phir phire, to maine kaha ke ya Rasulullah meri maan ke bete Ali ne daawa kya hai ke wo aik shakhs ko qatal kare ga jise maine panah di hai, falan bin Hubaira. To Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya ke hum ne panah di jise tum ne panah di aey Umm Hani. Umm Hani ne kaha ke ye chasht ke waqt tha."
"358","Mujhe Malik se, unhon ne Ibn Shihab se, unhon ne Urwa bin Zubair se, unhon ne Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ki zauja Aaisha se riwayat kya ke unhon ne kaha ke maine Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ko kabhi Chasht ki nafl padhte na dekha, halanke main use padhti hun, aur Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) amal ko chhor dete jab ke Aap use karna pasand karte is khauf se ke log is par amal karein aur un par farz kar di jaye."
"359","Mujhe Malik se, unhon ne Zaid bin Aslam se, unhon ne Aaisha se riwayat kya ke wo Chasht ki aath rakat Namaz padhti thin phir kehti ke agar mere maan baap mere liye phela diye jain to main inhein na chhorun."
"360","Mujhe Yahya ne Malik se, unhon ne Ishaq bin Abdullah bin Abi Talha se, unhon ne Anas bin Malik se riwayat kya ke un ki dadi Mulaika ne Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ko khane ke liye bulaya aur Aap ne us mein se khaya, phir Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya ke khade ho jao taake main tumhein Namaz padhaun. Anas ne kaha ke main apni aik chatai ki taraf khada hua jo lambe arse pehne jane se kaali ho gai thi aur maine us par pani chhidka, phir Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) us par khade hue aur main aur yateem Aap ke peechhe saf mein khade hue aur budhiya hamare peechhe, phir humhein do rakat padhai phir phire."
"361","Mujhe Malik se, unhon ne Ibn Shihab se, unhon ne Ubaidullah bin Abdullah bin Utba se riwayat kya ke unhon ne kaha ke main dopahar mein Umar bin Khattab ke paas dakhil hua aur unhein nafl padhte paya, phir main un ke peechhe khada hua to unhon ne mujhe qareeb kya yahan tak ke mujhe apne daain apne barabar kar diya, phir jab Yarfa aaya to main peechhe hata aur hum un ke peechhe safon mein khade hue."
"362","Mujhe Yahya ne Malik se, unhon ne Zaid bin Aslam se, unhon ne Abdur Rahman bin Abi Saeed Khudri se, unhon ne apne walid se riwayat kya ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya ke jab tum mein se koi Namaz padh raha ho to kisi ko apne samne se guzarne na de aur jitna ho sake use roke, phir agar inkar kare to us se lade kyunke wo shaitan hai."
"363","Mujhe Malik se, unhon ne Umar bin Ubaidullah ke ghulam Abul Nazar se, unhon ne Busr bin Saeed se riwayat kya ke Zaid bin Khalid Juhani ne unhein Abu Juhaim ke paas bheja taake un se sawal karein ke unhon ne Namazi ke samne se guzarne wale ke bare mein Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) se kya suna hai, to Abu Juhaim ne kaha ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya ke agar Namazi ke samne se guzarne wala janta ke us par kya hai to chalis tak khada rehna us ke liye is se behtar hota ke wo us ke samne se guzre. Abul Nazar ne kaha ke main nahi janta ke kaha ke chalis din ya mahina ya saal."
"364","Mujhe Malik se, unhon ne Zaid bin Aslam se, unhon ne Ata bin Yasar se riwayat kya ke Kaab Ahbar ne kaha ke agar Namazi ke samne se guzarne wala janta ke us par kya hai to us ke sath zameen mein dhans jana us ke liye is se behtar hota ke wo us ke samne se guzre."
"365","Mujhe Malik se riwayat pahunchi ke Abdullah bin Umar napasand karte they ke aurton ke samne se guzra jaye jab ke wo Namaz padh rahi hon."
"366","Mujhe Malik se, unhon ne Nafi se riwayat kya ke Abdullah bin Umar kisi ke samne se na guzarte aur kisi ko apne samne se guzarne na dete."
"367","Mujhe Yahya ne Malik se, unhon ne Ibn Shihab se, unhon ne Ubaidullah bin Abdullah bin Utba bin Masud se, unhon ne Abdullah bin Abbas se riwayat kya ke unhon ne kaha ke main gadhi par sawaar aaya jab ke main us din buloghat ke qareeb tha, aur Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) Mina mein logon ko Namaz padha rahe they, phir main saf ke baaz hisse ke samne se guzra aur utra aur gadhi ko charne ke liye chhor diya aur saf mein dakhil hua to kisi ne mujh par is ka inkar na kya."
"368","Mujhe Malik se riwayat pahunchi ke Saad bin Abi Waqqas baaz safon ke samne se guzarte jab ke Namaz khadi hoti. Malik ne kaha ke main is mein gunjaish dekhta hun jab Namaz khadi ki jaye aur Imam ehram baandh le aur shakhs ko masjid mein dakhil hone ka rasta safon ke darmiyan ke siwa na mile."
"369","Mujhe Malik se riwayat pahunchi ke Ali bin Abi Talib ne kaha ke Namazi ke samne se guzarne wali koi cheez Namaz ko nahi kaatti."
"370","Mujhe Malik se, unhon ne Ibn Shihab se, unhon ne Salim bin Abdullah se riwayat kya ke Abdullah bin Umar kehte they ke Namazi ke samne se guzarne wali koi cheez Namaz ko nahi kaatti."
"371","Mujhe Yahya ne Malik se riwayat kya ke unhein khabar pahunchi ke Abdullah bin Umar jab Namaz padhte to apni oontni se aadh karte."
"372","Mujhe Malik se, unhon ne Hisham bin Urwa se riwayat kya ke un ke walid maidan mein baghair sutra ke Namaz padhte they."
"373","Mujhe Yahya ne Malik se, unhon ne Qari Abu Jafar se riwayat kya ke unhon ne kaha ke maine Abdullah bin Umar ko dekha ke jab sajda karne jhukte to apni peshani ki jagah ke liye kankariyon par halka haath pherte."
"374","Mujhe Malik se, unhon ne Yahya bin Saeed se riwayat kya ke unhein khabar pahunchi ke Abu Zar kehte they ke kankariyon par aik martaba haath pherna aur unhein chhorna surkh oonton se behtar hai."
"375","Mujhe Yahya ne Malik se, unhon ne Nafi se riwayat kya ke Umar bin Khattab safon ko seedha karne ka hukm dete, phir jab un ke paas aate aur unhein khabar dete ke safein seedhi ho gain to takbeer kehte."
"376","Mujhe Malik se, unhon ne apne chacha Abu Suhail bin Malik se, unhon ne apne walid se riwayat kya ke unhon ne kaha ke main Usman bin Affan ke sath tha aur Namaz khadi hui jab ke main un se apne wazife ke bare mein baat kar raha tha, phir main un se baat karta raha jab ke wo apne jooton se kankariyan barabar karte rahe yahan tak ke un ke paas kuchh mard aae jinhein unhon ne safon ko seedha karne par muqarrar kya tha. Phir unhon ne unhein khabar di ke safein seedhi ho gain to unhon ne mujh se kaha ke saf mein seedhe ho jao. Phir takbeer kahi."
"377","Mujhe Yahya ne Malik se, unhon ne Basri Abdul Karim bin Abil Mukhariq se riwayat kya ke unhon ne kaha ke nabuwwat ke kalam mein se hai ke jab sharm na karo to jo chaho karo, aur Namaz mein dono haathon mein se aik ko dusre par rakhna, daayan ko baain par rakhna, aur iftar mein jaldi karna aur sehri se taqat lena."
"378","Mujhe Malik se, unhon ne Deenari Abu Hazim se, unhon ne Sahl bin Saad se riwayat kya ke unhon ne kaha ke logon ko hukm diya jata tha ke shakhs Namaz mein apna daayan haath apni baain kalaai par rakhe. Abu Hazim ne kaha ke main nahi janta magar ke wo ise marfoo bayan karte they."
"379","Mujhe Yahya ne Malik se, unhon ne Nafi se riwayat kya ke Abdullah bin Umar Namaz mein se kisi mein qunoot na padhte they."
"380","Mujhe Yahya ne Malik se, unhon ne Hisham bin Urwa se, unhon ne apne walid se riwayat kya ke Abdullah bin Arqam apne sathiyon ki imamat karte they, phir aik din Namaz hazir hui aur wo apni haajat ke liye gae phir laute aur kaha ke maine Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ko farmate suna ke jab tum mein se koi pakhana chahe to use Namaz se pehle is se ibtida karni chahiye."
"381","Mujhe Malik se, unhon ne Zaid bin Aslam se riwayat kya ke Umar bin Khattab ne kaha ke tum mein se koi apni ranon ko milate hue Namaz na padhe."
"382","Mujhe Yahya ne Malik se, unhon ne Abul Zinad se, unhon ne Aaraj se, unhon ne Abu Huraira se riwayat kya ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya ke farishte tum mein se kisi par dua karte hain jab tak wo apne musalle mein ho jis mein us ne Namaz padhi hai jab tak wo be-wuzu na ho, aey Allah use bakhsh de, aey Allah us par rehem kar."
"383","Mujhe Malik se, unhon ne Abul Zinad se, unhon ne Aaraj se, unhon ne Abu Huraira se riwayat kya ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya ke tum mein se koi musalsal Namaz mein hai jab tak Namaz use roke rakhe, use apne ghar walon ki taraf lautne se Namaz ke siwa koi cheez na roke."
"384","Mujhe Malik se, unhon ne Abu Bakr ke ghulam Sumay se riwayat kya ke Abu Bakr bin Abdur Rahman kehte they ke jo subah ya shaam masjid ki taraf jaye aur is ke siwa kuchh na chahe ke bhalai seekhe ya sikhaye phir apne ghar laut aae wo Allah ki raah mein jihad karne wale jaisa hai jo ghanimat lekar lauta."
"385","Mujhe Malik se, unhon ne Nuaim bin Abdullah Mujmir se riwayat kya ke unhon ne Abu Huraira ko kehte suna ke jab tum mein se koi Namaz padhe phir apne musalle mein baitha rahe to farishte us par dua karte rehte hain, aey Allah use bakhsh de, aey Allah us par rehem kar, phir agar wo apne musalle se uth kar masjid mein baith kar Namaz ka intezar kare to musalsal Namaz mein hai yahan tak ke Namaz padhe."
"386","Mujhe Malik se, unhon ne Ala bin Abdur Rahman bin Yaqub se, unhon ne apne walid se, unhon ne Abu Huraira se riwayat kya ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya ke kya main tumhein na bataun jis se Allah khatayein mitata hai aur darje buland karta hai, na-gawari ke waqt wuzu ko pura karna aur masjidon ki taraf zyada qadam aur Namaz ke baad Namaz ka intezar, to yehi sarhad ki hifazat hai, to yehi sarhad ki hifazat hai, to yehi sarhad ki hifazat hai."
"387","Mujhe Malik se riwayat pahunchi ke Saeed bin Musayyab ne kaha ke kaha jata hai ke azaan ke baad masjid se koi na nikle siwa us ke jo us ki taraf lautna chahe, magar munafiq."
"388","Mujhe Malik se, unhon ne Abdullah bin Zubair ke bete Amir se, unhon ne Amr bin Sulaim Zurqi se, unhon ne Ansari Abu Qatada se riwayat kya ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya ke jab tum mein se koi masjid mein dakhil ho to baithne se pehle do rakat padhe."
"389","Mujhe Malik se, unhon ne Umar bin Ubaidullah ke ghulam Abul Nazar se, unhon ne Abu Salma bin Abdur Rahman se riwayat kya ke unhon ne un se kaha ke kya maine tumhare sathi ko na dekha ke jab masjid mein dakhil hota hai to ruku karne se pehle baith jata hai. Abul Nazar ne kaha ke is se Umar bin Ubaidullah muraad hain aur wo is par unhein bura kehte they ke jab masjid mein dakhil ho to ruku karne se pehle baith jaye. Yahya ne kaha ke Malik ne kaha ke ye achchha hai lekin wajib nahi."
"390","Mujhe Yahya ne Malik se, unhon ne Nafi se riwayat kya ke Abdullah bin Umar jab sajda karte to apni hatheliyan us par rakhte jis par apni peshani rakhte. Nafi ne kaha ke maine unhein sakht sardi ke din dekha ke wo apni hatheliyan apne top se nikalte yahan tak ke unhein kankariyon par rakhte."
"391","Mujhe Malik se, unhon ne Nafi se riwayat kya ke Abdullah bin Umar kehte they ke jo apni peshani zameen par rakhe use apni hatheliyan us par rakhni chahiye jis par apni peshani rakhe, phir jab sar uthae to unhein uthae, kyunke dono haath sajda karte hain jaisa chehra sajda karta hai."
"392","Mujhe Yahya ne Malik se, unhon ne Abu Hazim Salma bin Dinar se, unhon ne Saidi Sahl bin Saad se riwayat kya ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) Banu Amr bin Auf ki taraf gae taake un ke darmiyan sulah karain aur Namaz hazir hui, phir moazzin Abu Bakr Siddiq ke paas aaya aur kaha ke kya tum logon ko Namaz padhaoge, to iqamat kaho, unhon ne kaha ke haan. Phir Abu Bakr ne Namaz padhai, phir Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) aae jab ke log Namaz mein they, phir chalte hue yahan tak ke saf mein khade hue, to logon ne taliyan bajain, aur Abu Bakr apni Namaz mein iltifaat na karte they, phir jab logon ne taliyan bahut bajain to Abu Bakr ne iltifaat kya aur Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ko dekha, to Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne unhein ishara kya ke apni jagah raho, phir Abu Bakr ne apne dono haath uthae aur Allah ki hamd ki is par jo Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne unhein is ka hukm diya tha, phir peechhe hate yahan tak ke saf mein barabar ho gae aur Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) aage badhe aur Namaz padhai phir phire aur farmaya ke aey Abu Bakr tumhein saabit rehne se kis ne roka jab maine tumhein hukm diya tha. To Abu Bakr ne kaha ke Abu Quhafa ke bete ke liye na tha ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ke samne Namaz padhe. Phir Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya ke mujhe kya hai, maine tumhein dekha ke tum ne taliyan bahut bajain, jo us ki Namaz mein koi cheez aa jaye use Subhan Allah kehna chahiye, kyunke jab wo Subhan Allah kahe to us ki taraf iltifaat kya jata hai, aur taliyan sirf aurton ke liye hain."
"393","Mujhe Malik se, unhon ne Nafi se riwayat kya ke Ibn Umar apni Namaz mein iltifaat na karte they."
"394","Mujhe Malik se, unhon ne Qari Abu Jafar se riwayat kya ke unhon ne kaha ke main Namaz padh raha tha jab ke Abdullah bin Umar mere peechhe they aur mujhe maloom na tha, phir maine iltifaat kya to unhon ne mujhe chhuya."
"395","Mujhe Yahya ne Malik se, unhon ne Ibn Shihab se, unhon ne Sahl bin Hunaif ke bete Abu Umama se riwayat kya ke unhon ne kaha ke Zaid bin Sabit masjid mein dakhil hue aur logon ko ruku mein paya to ruku kya phir chalte rahe yahan tak ke saf se mil gae."
"396","Mujhe Malik se riwayat pahunchi ke Abdullah bin Masud ruku mein chalte they."
"397","Mujhe Yahya ne Malik se, unhon ne Abdullah bin Abi Bakr bin Hazm se, unhon ne apne walid se, unhon ne Zurqi Amr bin Sulaim se riwayat kya ke unhon ne kaha ke mujhe Saidi Abu Humaid ne khabar di ke unhon ne kaha ke ya Rasulullah hum Aap par kaisey durood bhejein, to Aap ne farmaya ke kaho ke aey Allah Muhammad aur un ki biwiyon aur un ki aulaad par rehmat bhej jaisa tune Aal-e-Ibrahim par rehmat bheji, aur Muhammad aur un ki biwiyon aur un ki aulaad par barkat bhej jaisa tune Aal-e-Ibrahim par barkat bheji, beshak tu hamd wala buzurgi wala hai."
"398","Mujhe Malik se, unhon ne Nuaim bin Abdullah Mujmir se, unhon ne Muhammad bin Abdullah bin Zaid se riwayat kya ke unhon ne unhein Ansari Abu Masud se khabar di ke unhon ne kaha ke hamare paas Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) Saad bin Ubada ki majlis mein aae to un se Bashir bin Saad ne kaha ke Allah ne humein hukm diya hai ke Aap par durood bhejein aey Allah ke Rasul, to hum Aap par kaisey durood bhejein, unhon ne kaha ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) khamosh rahe yahan tak ke hum ne tamanna ki ke unhon ne Aap se sawal na kya hota, phir farmaya ke kaho ke aey Allah Muhammad aur Aal-e-Muhammad par rehmat bhej jaisa tune Ibrahim par rehmat bheji, aur Muhammad aur Aal-e-Muhammad par barkat bhej jaisa tune Aal-e-Ibrahim par jahano mein barkat bheji, beshak tu hamd wala buzurgi wala hai, aur salam waisa hi hai jaisa tum jante ho."
"399","Mujhe Malik se, unhon ne Abdullah bin Dinar se riwayat kya ke unhon ne kaha ke maine Abdullah bin Umar ko dekha ke Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ki qabr par khade hote aur Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) par aur Abu Bakr aur Umar par durood bhejte."
"400","Mujhe Yahya ne Malik se, unhon ne Nafi se, unhon ne Ibn Umar se riwayat kya ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) Zuhr se pehle do rakat aur is ke baad do rakat aur Maghrib ke baad apne ghar mein do rakat aur Isha ki Namaz ke baad do rakat padhte they, aur Juma ke baad Namaz na padhte they yahan tak ke laut jate phir do rakat padhte."
"401","Mujhe Malik se, unhon ne Abul Zinad se, unhon ne Aaraj se, unhon ne Abu Huraira se riwayat kya ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya ke kya tum dekhte ho ke mera qibla yahan hai, Allah ki qasam mujh par tumhara khushu aur na tumhara ruku chhupa hai, main tumhein apni pusht ke peechhe se dekhta hun."
"402","Mujhe Malik se, unhon ne Nafi se, unhon ne Abdullah bin Umar se riwayat kya ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) Quba sawaar aur paidal aate they."
"403","Mujhe Malik se, unhon ne Yahya bin Saeed se, unhon ne Nomani Nomaan bin Murra se riwayat kya ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya ke sharabi aur chor aur zani ke bare mein tum kya dekhte ho. Aur ye is se pehle tha ke un ke bare mein nazil ho. Unhon ne kaha ke Allah aur us ke Rasul behtar jante hain. Aap ne farmaya ke ye fahashiyan hain aur un mein saza hai, aur sab se buri chori wo hai jo apni Namaz chori kare. Unhon ne kaha ke wo apni Namaz kaisey chori karta hai ya Rasulullah, Aap ne farmaya ke us ka ruku aur us ka sajda pura nahi karta."
"404","Mujhe Malik se, unhon ne Hisham bin Urwa se, unhon ne apne walid se riwayat kya ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya ke apni Namaz mein se kuchh apne gharon mein rakho."
"405","Mujhe Malik se, unhon ne Nafi se riwayat kya ke Abdullah bin Umar kehte they ke jab beemar sajda karne ki taqat na rakhe to apne sar se ishara kare aur apni peshani ki taraf koi cheez na uthae."
"406","Mujhe Malik se, unhon ne Rabia bin Abi Abdur Rahman se riwayat kya ke Abdullah bin Umar jab masjid aate jab ke log Namaz padh chuke hote to farz Namaz se ibtida karte aur is se pehle koi cheez na padhte."
"407","Mujhe Malik se, unhon ne Nafi se riwayat kya ke Abdullah bin Umar aik shakhs ke paas se guzre jab ke wo Namaz padh raha tha aur us ne use salam kya to us shakhs ne kalam se jawab diya, phir Abdullah bin Umar us ki taraf laute aur un se kaha ke jab tum mein se kisi ko salam kya jaye jab ke wo Namaz padh raha ho to kalam na kare aur apne haath se ishara kare."
"408","Mujhe Malik se, unhon ne Nafi se riwayat kya ke Abdullah bin Umar kehte they ke jo Namaz bhool jaye aur use yaad na aae magar jab ke wo Imam ke sath ho, phir jab Imam salam phere to wo Namaz padhe jo bhoola tha phir is ke baad dusri padhe."
"409","Mujhe Malik se, unhon ne Yahya bin Saeed se, unhon ne Muhammad bin Yahya bin Hibban se, unhon ne apne chacha Wasi bin Hibban se riwayat kya ke unhon ne kaha ke main Namaz padh raha tha jab ke Abdullah bin Umar qibla ki deewar se apni pusht lagaye they, phir jab maine apni Namaz puri ki to un ki taraf apne baain pehlu se phira, to Abdullah bin Umar ne kaha ke tumhein apne daain se phirne se kis ne roka, unhon ne kaha ke maine kaha ke maine Aap ko dekha to Aap ki taraf phira. Abdullah ne kaha ke tum ne durust kya, ke kehne wala kehta hai ke apne daain se phiro, phir jab tum Namaz padho to jidhar chaho phiro, agar chaho to apne daain se aur agar chaho to apne baain se."
"410","Mujhe Malik se, unhon ne Hisham bin Urwa se, unhon ne apne walid se, unhon ne Muhajireen mein se aik shakhs se jis mein wo harj nahi samajhte they riwayat kya ke unhon ne Abdullah bin Amr bin Aas se sawal kya ke kya main oonton ke baithne ki jagah mein Namaz padhun, to Abdullah ne kaha ke nahi, lekin bakriyon ke badhe mein Namaz padho."
"411","Mujhe Malik se, unhon ne Ibn Shihab se, unhon ne Saeed bin Musayyab se riwayat kya ke unhon ne kaha ke kaunsi Namaz hai jis ki har rakat mein baitha jata hai, phir Saeed ne kaha ke ye Maghrib hai jab tum se us mein se aik rakat foot jaye, aur isi tarah Namaz ki tamam sunnat hai."
"412","Mujhe Yahya ne Malik se, unhon ne Abdullah bin Zubair ke bete Amir se, unhon ne Zurqi Amr bin Sulaim se, unhon ne Ansari Abu Qatada se riwayat kya ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) Namaz padhte they jab ke Aap Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ki beti Zainab ki beti Umama ko uthae hue they, aur Abul Aas bin Rabia bin Abd Shams ke liye, phir jab sajda karte to use rakh dete aur jab khade hote to use utha lete."
"413","Mujhe Malik se, unhon ne Abul Zinad se, unhon ne Aaraj se, unhon ne Abu Huraira se riwayat kya ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya ke raat ke farishte aur din ke farishte tum mein baari baari aate hain aur Asr ki Namaz aur Fajr ki Namaz mein jama hote hain, phir jo tum mein raat guzare woh upar chadhte hain aur wo un se sawal karta hai jab ke wo unhein un se zyada janta hai ke tum ne mere bandon ko kaisey chhora, to wo kehte hain ke hum ne unhein chhora jab ke wo Namaz padh rahe they aur hum un ke paas aae jab ke wo Namaz padh rahe they."
"414","Mujhe Malik se, unhon ne Hisham bin Urwa se, unhon ne apne walid se, unhon ne Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ki zauja Aaisha se riwayat kya ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya ke Abu Bakr ko hukm do ke logon ko Namaz padhae. To Aaisha ne kaha ke aey Allah ke Rasul Abu Bakr jab Aap ke muqam mein khade honge to rone se logon ko na suna sakein ge, to Umar ko hukm dein ke logon ko Namaz padhae. Aap ne farmaya ke Abu Bakr ko hukm do ke logon ko Namaz padhae. Aaisha ne kaha ke maine Hafsa se kaha ke un se kaho ke Abu Bakr jab Aap ke muqam mein khade honge to rone se logon ko na suna sakein ge, to Umar ko hukm dein ke logon ko Namaz padhae, to Hafsa ne aisa kya, phir Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya ke tum Yusuf ki sathiyon wali aurtein ho, Abu Bakr ko hukm do ke logon ko Namaz padhae. To Hafsa ne Aaisha se kaha ke main tum se kabhi bhalai na paun gi."
"415","Mujhe Malik se, unhon ne Ibn Shihab se, unhon ne Laithi Ata bin Yazeed se, unhon ne Ubaidullah bin Adi bin Khiyar se riwayat kya ke unhon ne kaha ke jab Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) logon ke darmiyan baithe they to Aap ke paas aik shakhs aaya aur sargoshi ki, phir maloom na hua ke unhon ne Aap ko kya sargoshi ki yahan tak ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne buland awaz ki, to wo munafiqon mein se aik shakhs ke qatal ki ijazat mang raha tha, phir Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne buland awaz mein farmaya ke kya wo gawahi nahi deta ke Allah ke siwa koi mabood nahi aur Muhammad Allah ke Rasul hain. Us shakhs ne kaha ke kyun nahi, lekin us ki koi gawahi nahi. Aap ne farmaya ke kya wo Namaz nahi padhta. Us ne kaha ke kyun nahi, lekin us ki koi Namaz nahi. To Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya ke yehi wo hain jin se Allah ne mujhe mana kya hai."
"416","Mujhe Malik se, unhon ne Zaid bin Aslam se, unhon ne Ata bin Yasar se riwayat kya ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya ke aey Allah meri qabr ko but na bana jo pooja jaye, Allah ka ghazab us qoum par sakht hua jis ne apne nabiyon ki qabron ko masjidein bana liya."
"417","Mujhe Malik se, unhon ne Ibn Shihab se, unhon ne Ansari Mahmood bin Rabi se riwayat kya ke Itban bin Malik apni qoum ki imamat karte they jab ke wo andhe they, aur unhon ne Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) se kaha ke andhera aur barish aur sailab hota hai aur main aankh ka andha shakhs hun, to aey Allah ke Rasul mere ghar mein aik jagah Namaz padhein jise main musalla banaun. Phir Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) un ke paas aae aur farmaya ke tum kahan pasand karte ho ke main Namaz padhun. To unhon ne Aap ko ghar mein se aik jagah ki taraf ishara kya aur Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne us mein Namaz padhi."
"418","Mujhe Malik se, unhon ne Ibn Shihab se, unhon ne Tamimi Abbad bin Tamim se, unhon ne apne chacha se riwayat kya ke unhon ne Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ko dekha ke masjid mein chit lete hue they aur apna aik paon dusre par rakhe hue they."
"419","Mujhe Malik se, unhon ne Ibn Shihab se, unhon ne Saeed bin Musayyab se riwayat kya ke Umar bin Khattab aur Usman bin Affan, Allah un dono se raazi ho, aisa karte they."
"420","Mujhe Malik se, unhon ne Yahya bin Saeed se riwayat kya ke Abdullah bin Masud ne aik insan se kaha ke tum aise zamane mein ho jis ke faqeeh bahut aur jis ke qari thode hain, is mein Quran ki hadon ki hifazat ki jati hai aur us ke huroof zaya kiye jate hain, sawal karne wala thoda aur dene wala bahut hai, is mein Namaz lambi karte hain aur khutba chhota karte hain, apne amalon ko apni khwahishon se pehle rakhte hain, aur logon par aik zamana aae ga jis ke faqeeh thode aur jis ke qari bahut honge, is mein Quran ke huroof ki hifazat ki jaye gi aur us ki hadein zaya ki jain gi, sawal karne wala bahut aur dene wala thoda hoga, is mein khutba lamba karein ge aur Namaz chhoti karein ge, is mein apni khwahishon ko apne amalon se pehle rakhein ge."
"421","Mujhe Malik se, unhon ne Yahya bin Saeed se riwayat kya ke unhon ne kaha ke mujhe khabar pahunchi ke bande ke amal mein se sab se pehle jis mein nazar ki jati hai Namaz hai, phir agar us se qubool ki gai to us ke baqi amal mein nazar ki jati hai, aur agar us se qubool na ki gai to us ke amal mein se kisi cheez mein nazar na ki jaye gi."
"422","Mujhe Malik se, unhon ne Hisham bin Urwa se, unhon ne apne walid se, unhon ne Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ki zauja Aaisha se riwayat kya ke unhon ne kaha ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ke nazdeek sab se pasandida amal wo tha jis par us ka karne wala hamesha rahe."
"423","Mujhe Malik se riwayat pahunchi ke Amir bin Saad bin Abi Waqqas se, unhon ne apne walid se riwayat kya ke unhon ne kaha ke do bhai they, phir un mein se aik apne sathi se chalis raat pehle halaak hua, phir pehle ki fazilat ka Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ke paas zikr hua to Aap ne farmaya ke kya dusra musalman na tha. Unhon ne kaha ke kyun nahi ya Rasulullah, aur wo bura na tha. To Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya ke tumhein kya maloom ke us ki Namaz use kahan pahunchi, Namaz ki misaal tum mein se kisi ke darwaze par gehre meethe dariya jaisi hai jis mein wo har din paanch martaba ghusta hai, phir tum kya dekhte ho ke ye us ke mail mein se kuchh baqi rakhe ga, phir tum nahi jante ke us ki Namaz use kahan pahunchi."
"424","Mujhe Malik se riwayat pahunchi ke Ata bin Yasar jab un ke paas se masjid mein bechne walon mein se koi guzarta to use bulate aur us se sawal karte ke tumhare paas kya hai aur tum kya chahte ho, phir agar wo unhein khabar deta ke wo use bechna chahta hai to kehte ke tum duniya ke bazaar mein jao, aur ye aakhirat ka bazaar hai."
"425","Mujhe Malik se riwayat pahunchi ke Umar bin Khattab ne masjid ke kinare mein aik sehan banaya jise Batha kaha jata hai aur kaha ke jo shor karna ya sher padhna ya apni awaz buland karna chahe wo is sehan ki taraf nikal jaye."
"426","Mujhe Yahya ne Malik se, unhon ne apne chacha Abu Suhail bin Malik se, unhon ne apne walid se riwayat kya ke unhon ne Talha bin Ubaidullah ko kehte suna ke Najd walon mein se aik shakhs Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ke paas aaya jis ke baal bikhre they, us ki awaz ki goonj sunai deti thi lekin samajh na aata tha ke wo kya kehta hai yahan tak ke qareeb aaya, phir wo Islam ke bare mein sawal kar raha tha, to Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne un se farmaya ke din aur raat mein paanch Namazein hain. Us ne kaha ke kya in ke siwa mujh par kuchh hai, Aap ne farmaya ke nahi magar ke tum nafl karo. Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya ke aur Ramzan ke mahine ka roza. Us ne kaha ke kya is ke siwa mujh par kuchh hai, Aap ne farmaya ke nahi magar ke tum nafl karo. Unhon ne kaha ke aur Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne Zakat ka zikr kya. To us ne kaha ke kya is ke siwa mujh par kuchh hai, Aap ne farmaya ke nahi magar ke tum nafl karo. Unhon ne kaha ke wo shakhs peeth pher kar gaya jab ke wo kehta tha ke Allah ki qasam main is par na zyada karunga aur na is mein se kam karunga. To Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya ke wo shakhs kamyab hua agar sach kaha."
"427","Mujhe Malik se, unhon ne Abul Zinad se, unhon ne Aaraj se, unhon ne Abu Huraira se riwayat kya ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya ke shaitan tum mein se kisi ke sar ki gaddi par jab wo sota hai teen girah lagata hai, har girah ki jagah par marta hai ke tum par lambi raat hai to so jao, phir agar bedaar ho aur Allah ko yaad kare to aik girah khul jati hai, phir agar wuzu kare to aik girah khul jati hai, phir agar Namaz padhe to us ki girahien khul jatin hain, phir subah chust aur achchhe dil ke sath karta hai, warna bure dil aur sust hote hue subah karta hai."
